<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian G.Cappa full year profits rise.</title>
<headline>Nigerian G.Cappa full year profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian construction company G. Cappa full year results to end March 1996. (In million naira unless stated).</p>
<p>				   1996	     1995</p>
<p> Turnover			1,800    vs   1,200</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	105.2  vs	77.1</p>
<p> Taxation			   18.0  vs	30.1</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	  87.2  vs	47.0</p>
<p> Dividend			 30 kobo vs     45 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE - The 1996 dividend is on an enlarged shareholding following a recently concluded rights issue.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
